719	com\nIllia Polosukhin∗‡\nillia.polosukhin@gmail.com\nAbstract\nThe dominant sequence transduction models are based on complex recurrent or\nconvolutional neural networks that include an encoder and a decoder. The best\nperforming models also connect the encoder and decoder through an attention\nmechanism.	{"type": "text", "page": 1, "source": "attention.pdf", "doc_sha256": "a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"c7bd69a4a9506688a175944a87be6c187102416cad05abffe47a3c94d2ab95a6\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 1, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"94800a1e-95ee-413e-b15a-3a1ac06e6ec2\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 1, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"e8351d34b80f67f855d706add0e047c1666b253596781a0299c27b5467360ead\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"d4c9e019-39de-4deb-88de-974080210527\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 1, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"f234ec99c764c3c26972ad651b58a8d1de4758d4afdb6a8a67e6d55e40587cb6\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"ee80e1d7-3d2f-4503-92fc-23ffa6b6c5f5\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"54ca29ab56c3964c51bb9a5c68e212d55e14cae081816117318735aadc9c081e\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNode