731	as memory constraints limit batching across examples. Recent work has achieved\nsigniﬁcant improvements in computational efﬁciency through factorization tricks [18] and conditional\ncomputation [26], while also improving model performance in case of the latter. The fundamental\nconstraint of sequential computation, however, remains.	{"type": "text", "page": 2, "source": "attention.pdf", "doc_sha256": "a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"3d6f1783b31786abafd6d9ce789d1096dab5ba3f615738fd7a0929efb15ef25e\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 2, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"711dbde9-52f3-4cfd-afe5-ae266906e698\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 2, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"ca442522915e8d468b01d28699b6d81e679aa1a3bb32780e6de9272c8ee67873\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"36e6a5c3-ae19-4ec0-a0d5-9910ab8ffd29\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 2, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"53c028ec6b3e76812277865c599f29a5cf5bbb1e993e1f6a2ec2d9f4ab4c8914\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"8408345e-4881-4c63-ab82-d08db6eb16b3\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"22f42922512985d9ac9904ce582c3020c80d9002e69dddad91d08c93e37ba2a9\\", \\"c