735	2\nBackground\nThe goal of reducing sequential computation also forms the foundation of the Extended Neural GPU\n[20], ByteNet [15] and ConvS2S [8], all of which use convolutional neural networks as basic building\nblock, computing hidden representations in parallel for all input and output positions.	{"type": "text", "page": 2, "source": "attention.pdf", "doc_sha256": "a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"ef3422eb021e0b34ae6f80e09ea77a75f6fb29e95b3cd11d27f44b5dc931fa3a\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 2, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"711dbde9-52f3-4cfd-afe5-ae266906e698\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 2, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"ca442522915e8d468b01d28699b6d81e679aa1a3bb32780e6de9272c8ee67873\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"511157f3-e96a-44ec-888c-fa2e545b7919\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 2, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"deb6c922065efce17f0971b72524eec4f8ba1c012bf09f2e515f12df43d27a05\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"78f4991c-62e4-4d69-9068-336868a2f6a9\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"8e3fba8d2c568fdf66dca93af839a8a9a22ffa0b38f0e0643a959a541bdae1a8\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo