774	This\nconsists of two linear transformations with a ReLU activation in between.\nFFN(x) = max(0, xW1 + b1)W2 + b2\n(2)\nWhile the linear transformations are the same across different positions, they use different parameters\nfrom layer to layer.	{"type": "text", "page": 5, "source": "attention.pdf", "doc_sha256": "a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"740b0c984a0018db4e5813ab2ffbee2fd7e59f8a841a9ac967ee0b78f54027bc\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 5, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"9a247551-4775-4e02-98bf-d97b4f4c1f33\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 5, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"de4f19de4c1eac8e91c0cd2ff74781bdfae6bc53feec2abca44558a3c5d30b6a\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"38158451-24ef-497b-a977-ec56fcb7821f\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 5, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"1713ad7d38b8aff0076a0b75f1e77a750324133d0f585ec233af011aec796ecd\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"f9f010fa-8fd3-482e-b1cd-8073628396f8\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"f80d8df30e29125b5fc171922c6a1fb9b3251e5a9755fdf796a186617cd1ee4d\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}}, \\"metadata_template\\": \\"{key}: {value}\\", \\"