810	We used\nwarmup_steps = 4000.\n5.4\nRegularization\nWe employ three types of regularization during training:\nResidual Dropout\nWe apply dropout [27] to the output of each sub-layer, before it is added to the\nsub-layer input and normalized.	{"type": "text", "page": 7, "source": "attention.pdf", "doc_sha256": "a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"704caa66ae7771f99f591fe1b322771552758ee614fbbeba521e414b67105471\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [\\"type\\", \\"page\\", \\"source\\", \\"doc_sha256\\"], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"c3d712d0-5387-454f-9b5f-017a86463496\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"0f6a09a68cb8d95efc3b670b42bd6c4998811f5ad451e2509487347a1cae8543\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"472afff0-a299-4146-9d18-7f6c9e60ab74\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\", \\"doc_sha256\\": \\"a0efa62491d3455cc071d16fb2cd6dc7172f2fa021b1bea951d78338c87d4d7f\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"f5eb5c7e3626b24c68e6afd2c577baf81d08fdb5303c3cb6c5c6cd9ae62da69c\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"ba2b80b3-a160-4217-bad1-c9ed6d1d57b0\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"f82e670dbda66a41e93980254bccde56e3c72ac7910a5585612406cc6ae5f092\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}}, \\"metadata_template\\": \\"{key}: {value}\\", \\"meta